**Caveats**
- I did not read the full bodies of the six type-only consumers. Their impact is inferred from how they use the type, not from a traced runtime path.
- Line ranges for single-line matches are approximate, and I did not confirm the `NumericObservation` props lines in each file.
- The framework's own `Concept` consumers (esm-emr-api types, esm-implementer-tools-app) are outside the chart and not listed.

